-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Lineage
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Parts of this code were first adapted from an earlier, unpublished project
of the same author ("oasis"): among them the run lifecycle (agent runner,
history compaction, context report and probe, model slots and usage meter),
the work orders, receipts, run tree and attempt ledger, the action gate and
locks, the web tools, the run manifest, the OS isolation runtime, the
subscription sign-in and credential store, the desktop shell, and parts of
the interface (shell, thread, desk, outline, composer, replay). Source files
that say "adapted from oasis ..., see NOTICE" refer to this paragraph. The
TypeScript backend (backend-ts/, contract/) is a rewrite of an earlier
Python backend of this repository and carries the same lineage.
